WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.398
If a strategic deal is real but stalled, the problem is rarely another generic follow-up.

00:00:05.398 --> 00:00:10.795
The Enterprise Opportunity Workshop is a paid working session built around one live, material opportunity.

00:00:10.795 --> 00:00:15.833
We map the buying group, commercial pressure, internal blockers, decision path, and next move.

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:21.590
This is for enterprise revenue teams carrying a deal where the cost of delay is high.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:24.829
We do not leave the team with a theory.

00:00:24.829 --> 00:00:32.745
We leave with an account plan the owners can execute immediately, including stakeholder moves, evidence gaps, and the next commitment to secure.

00:00:32.745 --> 00:00:39.582
The proof is movement: a new stakeholder engaged, a decision step confirmed, risk exposed early, or the opportunity advanced.

00:00:39.582 --> 00:00:46.369
If one deal matters enough to deserve focused executive work, book a qualified fifteen-minute conversation and bring the opportunity.
